    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "guard:b4->n12",
        "action:n12"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "However, if the answer is \"Yes\", then we give it priority."
      ],
      "justification": "Redundant restatement of the priority assignment logic; preserves behaviour."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "guard:b5->n15",
        "action:n15"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "And if the answer is \"Yes\" again, then we enter the invoice in SAP."
      ],
      "justification": "Models the subsequent positive decision to enter the invoice."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "guard:b5->e3"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "And if the answer is \"Yes\" again, then we enter the invoice in SAP."
      ],
